                                "sense_id": "1a16564f-e7bb-38bf-8282-31efa694757e",
                                "text": "“Weel may ye mind, yon night sae black, Whan fearfu' winds loud gurled, And mony a lum dang down—and stack, Heigh i' the air up swirled, Alangst yon brae, ye clam, and stack,"
